      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "mag_crane",
      "narration": "Run electricity through a coiled wire and you get an electromagnet you can switch on and off.",
      "on_screen_text": "The electromagnet",
      "highlight_words": [
        "electromagnet"
      ],
      "sfx": "riser",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "mag_crane",
      "narration": "With them, scrapyard cranes lift entire cars.",
      "on_screen_text": "It lifts cars",
      "highlight_words": [
        "cars"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "mag_train",
      "narration": "And they make trains float: Shanghai's reached about four hundred and thirty kilometers per hour.",
      "on_screen_text": "Floating trains",
      "highlight_words": [
        "Floating"
      ],
      "sfx": "whoosh",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "mag_mri",
      "narration": "In hospitals, MRI machines use magnets of up to three teslas, hundreds of times a fridge magnet.",
